WEBVTT

00:04:59.197 --> 00:05:05.463
What if we're the ones
to plant seeds of change,

00:05:05.497 --> 00:05:07.863
seeds of influence,

00:05:07.863 --> 00:05:09.897
seeds of difference.

00:05:09.930 --> 00:05:11.797
Now, to be fair,

00:05:11.830 --> 00:05:15.230
I cannot promise you
that just because you plant the seed,

00:05:15.263 --> 00:05:17.397
that it will get water,

00:05:17.430 --> 00:05:20.963
that it'll get any sunlight
or even a little fertilizer.

00:05:21.797 --> 00:05:26.597
But what I can tell you
is that if you don't plant it,

00:05:26.630 --> 00:05:27.863
who will?